    "# The HAReyMain module\n",
    "The process of creating the constellations plots is automated by the __HAReyMain__ module, which creates plots similar to HARey's drawings.\n",
    "\n",
    "To make cards that can be used by everyone in their native language, I added the __names.csv__ file, which contains the keys to identify the objects inside the HARey module and the translated names. The default language is IAU-EN, which is the standard IAU denomination of objects; ENGLISH uses the names that HARey wrote in his book. For now only ENGLISH and ITALIAN are supported, but I'd like some help to add more languages.\n",
    "\n",
    "The names also include newlines to wrap around long ones (this works in the Matplotlib plots but not in InkScape, see the SIS_SCRIPT section)."
   ]
  },
